@startuml
title AIGCT Architecture - Interaction Diagram (Horizontal Layout)

' --- FIXES FOR LABEL VISIBILITY ---
skinparam sequenceParticipantSpacing 90
skinparam sequenceMessageAlignment left
skinparam sequenceMessageFontSize 12

skinparam defaultFontStyle bold
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBorderColor #336699
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #eef7ff
  LifeLineBorderColor #336699
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #eef7ff
  ArrowColor #333333
}

' --- PARTICIPANTS ---
participant "Browser / User" as Browser
participant "Streamlit App\n(app.py)" as Streamlit
participant "Groq LLM" as Groq
participant "Tool Layer\n(aigct_tools.py)" as Tools
participant "AIGCT Query Manager\n(SQLite DB)" as QM

' --- INTERACTIONS ---
Browser -> Streamlit : 1. submit question
Streamlit -> Groq : 2. send request\n(system prompt + history + tools)
Groq -> Streamlit : 3. tool-call reply
Streamlit -> Tools : 4. dispatch tool call
Tools -> QM : 5. execute query
QM -> Tools : 6. DataFrame result
Tools -> Streamlit : 7. markdown + table
Streamlit -> Groq : 8. send tool result back to LLM
Groq -> Streamlit : 9. final text summary
Streamlit -> Browser : 10. render summary + table

@enduml
